{"id":"pan-de-jamon","source":"El Placer de Comer, elplacerdecomer.com","tags":["bread","venezuelan","baking","christmas"],"time_min":180,"time_max":240,"kcal_per_serving":3200,"kj_per_serving":13389,"serving_weight_g":1200,"title":{"de":"Pan de Jamón","en":"Pan de Jamón","es":"Pan de Jamón"},"subtitle":{"de":"Venezolanisches Weihnachtsbrot mit Schinken, Rosinen und Oliven","en":"Venezuelan Christmas bread with ham, raisins and olives","es":"Pan venezolano relleno de jamón, pasas y aceitunas"},"servings_options":[1,2,3],"ingredients":[{"id":"trockenhefe","amounts":["7 g","14 g","21 g"],"de":"Trockenhefe","en":"dry yeast","es":"levadura seca"},{"id":"lauwarmes_wasser","amounts":["40 ml","80 ml","120 ml"],"de":"lauwarmes Wasser","en":"warm water","es":"agua tibia"},{"id":"milch","amounts":["120 ml","240 ml","360 ml"],"de":"Milch (Zimmertemperatur)","en":"milk (room temperature)","es":"leche (a temperatura ambiente)"},{"id":"mehl","amounts":["330 g","660 g","1000 g"],"de":"Weizenmehl (Type 550)","en":"wheat flour (all-purpose)","es":"harina de trigo"},{"id":"pflanzenfett","amounts":["25 g","50 g","75 g"],"de":"Pflanzenfett (z. B. Palmin)","en":"vegetable shortening","es":"manteca vegetal"},{"id":"butter","amounts":["30 g","60 g","90 g"],"de":"Butter","en":"butter","es":"mantequilla"},{"id":"salz","amounts":["2 g","4 g","7 g"],"de":"Salz","en":"salt","es":"sal"},{"id":"zucker","amounts":["33 g","66 g","100 g"],"de":"Zucker","en":"sugar","es":"azúcar"},{"id":"eier","amounts":["1","2","3"],"de":"Eier","en":"eggs","es":"huevos"},{"id":"schinken","amounts":["330 g","660 g","1000 g"],"de":"gekochter Schinken, grob gehackt","en":"cooked ham, coarsely chopped","es":"jamón cocido, picado en trozos grandes"},{"id":"rosinen","amounts":["40 g","80 g","120 g"],"de":"Rosinen","en":"raisins","es":"pasas"},{"id":"oliven","amounts":["10 Stk.","20 Stk.","30 Stk."],"de":"Oliven (entsteint, gehackt)","en":"olives (pitted and chopped)","es":"aceitunas (sin hueso, picadas)"},{"id":"eigelb","amounts":["1","1","2"],"de":"Eigelb (zum Bestreichen)","en":"egg yolks (for glazing)","es":"yemas de huevo (para el glaseado)"}],"pantry":{"de":"1 TL Zucker (für Hefe), Butter zum Einfetten der Bleche","en":"1 tsp sugar (for yeast), butter for greasing the baking sheets","es":"1 cdta. de azúcar (para la levadura), mantequilla para engrasar las bandejas"},"equipment":{"de":["1 große Schüssel","1 Küchenmaschine oder Handmixer","1–3 Backbleche","Frischhaltefolie oder Küchentuch","Kühlschrank (Übernachtgare)"],"en":["1 large mixing bowl","1 stand mixer or hand mixer","1–3 baking sheets","cling film or kitchen towel","refrigerator (overnight proofing)"],"es":["1 bol grande","1 robot de cocina o batidora de mano","1–3 bandejas de horno","film transparente o paño de cocina","nevera (para reposo nocturno)"]},"steps":[{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Hefe aktivieren","text":"Trockenhefe, lauwarmes Wasser und 1 TL Zucker in einer kleinen Schüssel vermischen. Abgedeckt ca. 20 Minuten stehen lassen, bis die Mischung schäumt und die Hefe aktiv ist."},"en":{"title":"Activate the yeast","text":"Mix the dry yeast, warm water, and 1 tsp sugar in a small bowl. Cover and leave for about 20 minutes until the mixture foams and the yeast is active."},"es":{"title":"Activar la levadura","text":"Mezclar la levadura seca, el agua tibia y 1 cdta. de azúcar en un bol pequeño. Cubrir y dejar reposar unos 20 minutos hasta que la mezcla burbujee y la levadura esté activa."}},{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Vorteig ansetzen und gehen lassen","text":"Milch und Hefemischung in eine große Schüssel geben. Die Hälfte des Mehls (ca. 165/330/500 g) einarbeiten, bis ein glatter Vorteig entsteht. Abgedeckt an einem warmen Ort ca. 4 Stunden gehen lassen, bis der Teig sein Volumen deutlich vergrößert hat."},"en":{"title":"Make the starter dough and let it rise","text":"Add the milk and yeast mixture to a large bowl. Work in half the flour (approx. 165/330/500 g) until a smooth starter dough forms. Cover and leave in a warm place for about 4 hours until the dough has risen significantly."},"es":{"title":"Preparar el pre-fermento y dejar levar","text":"Agregar la leche y la mezcla de levadura a un bol grande. Incorporar la mitad de la harina (aprox. 165/330/500 g) hasta obtener una masa lisa. Cubrir y dejar reposar en un lugar cálido unas 4 horas hasta que la masa haya aumentado considerablemente de volumen."}},{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Restliches Mehl einarbeiten und Kühlschrankreife","text":"Das restliche Mehl in den Vorteig einarbeiten (bei Bedarf 2 EL kalte Milch zugeben, um eine geschmeidige Konsistenz zu erhalten). Den Teig abgedeckt 6–8 Stunden oder über Nacht im Kühlschrank ruhen lassen. Dieser Schritt entwickelt Aroma und macht den Teig leichter verarbeitbar."},"en":{"title":"Add remaining flour and refrigerate overnight","text":"Work the remaining flour into the starter dough (add 2 tbsp cold milk if needed to achieve a smooth consistency). Cover the dough and let it rest in the refrigerator for 6–8 hours or overnight. This step develops flavor and makes the dough easier to work with."},"es":{"title":"Añadir el resto de harina y refrigerar","text":"Incorporar el resto de la harina a la masa madre (agregar 2 cucharadas de leche fría si es necesario para obtener una consistencia suave). Cubrir la masa y dejar reposar en la nevera durante 6–8 horas o toda la noche. Este paso desarrolla el sabor y facilita el manejo de la masa."}},{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Teig ausarbeiten","text":"Den Teig aus dem Kühlschrank nehmen und auf Zimmertemperatur bringen. Pflanzenfett, Butter, Salz, Zucker und die Eier (eines nach dem anderen) einkneten. Den Teig ca. 100-mal auf die Arbeitsfläche werfen und falten (oder in der Küchenmaschine ca. 10 Minuten kneten), bis er glatt und elastisch ist und sich von den Händen löst."},"en":{"title":"Work the dough","text":"Remove the dough from the refrigerator and allow it to come to room temperature. Knead in the vegetable shortening, butter, salt, sugar, and eggs one at a time. Slap and fold the dough onto the work surface about 100 times (or knead in a stand mixer for about 10 minutes) until it is smooth, elastic, and no longer sticks to your hands."},"es":{"title":"Trabajar la masa","text":"Sacar la masa de la nevera y dejar que alcance la temperatura ambiente. Amasar incorporando la manteca vegetal, la mantequilla, la sal, el azúcar y los huevos de uno en uno. Golpear y plegar la masa sobre la superficie de trabajo unas 100 veces (o amasar en robot de cocina unos 10 minutos) hasta que esté lisa, elástica y no se pegue a las manos."}},{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Füllen und aufrollen","text":"Den Teig in 3 gleiche Teile teilen. Jedes Stück auf einer bemehlten Fläche zu einem Rechteck von ca. ½–1 cm Dicke ausrollen. Schinken, Rosinen und gehackte Oliven gleichmäßig darauf verteilen, dabei einen Rand von 2–3 cm lassen. Fest wie eine Roulade aufrollen und die Enden gut verschließen."},"en":{"title":"Fill and roll","text":"Divide the dough into 3 equal parts. Roll each piece out on a floured surface to a rectangle about ½–1 cm thick. Distribute the ham, raisins, and chopped olives evenly over it, leaving a 2–3 cm border. Roll up tightly like a Swiss roll and seal the ends well."},"es":{"title":"Rellenar y enrollar","text":"Dividir la masa en 3 partes iguales. Extender cada parte sobre una superficie enharinada hasta obtener un rectángulo de unos ½–1 cm de grosor. Distribuir el jamón, las pasas y las aceitunas picadas de manera uniforme, dejando un borde de 2–3 cm. Enrollar firmemente como un brazo de gitano y cerrar bien los extremos."}},{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Zweite Gare","text":"Die Teigrollen diagonal auf gebutterte Backbleche legen. Abgedeckt mit einem feuchten Tuch ca. 2 Stunden gehen lassen, bis sie ihr Volumen deutlich vergrößert haben."},"en":{"title":"Second rise","text":"Place the dough rolls diagonally on buttered baking sheets. Cover with a damp cloth and leave to rise for about 2 hours until they have risen significantly."},"es":{"title":"Segundo levado","text":"Colocar los rollos de masa en diagonal sobre las bandejas de horno enmantequilladas. Cubrir con un paño húmedo y dejar levar unas 2 horas hasta que hayan aumentado considerablemente de tamaño."}},{"image":null,"de":{"title":"Backen und glasieren","text":"Ofen auf 200 °C (Ober-/Unterhitze) bzw. 180 °C Umluft vorheizen. Jeden Laib zuerst 20 Minuten backen. Dann mit einer Mischung aus Eigelb, 2 EL Wasser und einer Prise Salz bestreichen und weitere 10 Minuten goldbraun fertigbacken. Die Laibe nacheinander backen und frisch aus dem Ofen am besten genießen."},"en":{"title":"Bake and glaze","text":"Preheat the oven to 200 °C (top/bottom heat) or 180 °C fan. Bake each loaf for 20 minutes first. Then brush with a mixture of egg yolk, 2 tbsp water, and a pinch of salt, and bake for a further 10 minutes until golden brown. Bake the loaves one at a time and enjoy them best fresh from the oven."},"es":{"title":"Hornear y glasear","text":"Precalentar el horno a 200 °C (calor arriba y abajo) o 180 °C con ventilador. Hornear cada pan durante 20 minutos primero. Luego pincelar con una mezcla de yema de huevo, 2 cucharadas de agua y una pizca de sal, y hornear otros 10 minutos hasta que estén dorados. Hornear los panes de uno en uno y disfrutarlos preferiblemente recién salidos del horno."}}],"nutrition":{"per_100g":{"energy_kj":1116,"energy_kcal":267,"fat_g":7.9,"sat_fat_g":3.2,"carbs_g":39.6,"sugars_g":4.6,"protein_g":10.0,"salt_g":0.54},"per_serving":{"energy_kj":13389,"energy_kcal":3200,"fat_g":95.0,"sat_fat_g":38.0,"carbs_g":475.0,"sugars_g":55.0,"protein_g":120.0,"salt_g":6.5}},"images":{"main":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"}}